            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Zones 0.1.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li>When the trial has ended, dragging a window with the zone modifier held now shows a short banner explaining that snapping is off, instead of doing nothing.</li>
  <li>Trial reminders are now sent: three days left, one day left, and when the trial ends.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
